            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "naples34102"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A very nice, simple and somewhat different salad. I didn’t care to add the basil pesto to the dressing, so I just cut up fresh basil, chiffonade style, and sprinkled it over the salad just before serving. I used “Our Favorite Balsamic Vinaigrette,” also from this site."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
