            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Casablancaise"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We liked this salad better than the traditional Caprese that uses only tomatoes basil and Mozzarella. \nThe only change I had to make was using a handful of torn fresh basil leaves for the basil paste. \nWe will be making this one again soon.",
